        "notes": "SS7a VIOLATION, not fixable inline because it is math: the block writes the Skein relation as 'q L_+ - q^{-1} L_- = (q - q^{-1}) L_0'. AGENTS.md 7a fixes the repo convention as L_+ - L_- = (q - q^{-1}) L_0, derived there from the Hecke relation sigma^2 = (q - q^{-1}) sigma + 1 by multiplying through by sigma^{-1} to get sigma - sigma^{-1} = q - q^{-1}, then sending sigma to L_+, sigma^{-1} to L_-, and 1 to L_0. The block's extra q and q^{-1} prefactors are the HOMFLY normalisation (a L_+ - a^{-1} L_- = z L_0), a different relation. reidemeister-mass-invariance.md in this same batch writes the CORRECT form, so the two blocks disagree. PROPOSED: L_+ - L_- = (q - q^{-1}) L_0."
